OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOvernight rain soon clearing.
OL,6,FThen the rest of the day will see some
OL,7,Fbright or sunny spells and a few
OL,8,Fpassing light showers. Fresh to strong
OL,9,Fwest to southwesterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will see clear
OL,12,Fperiods and the odd shower. Clear
OL,13,Fperiods and occasional passing showers
OL,14,Ffor the rest of the night. Fresh to
OL,15,Fstrong west to southwesterly winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FA mixture of sunny spells and
OL,18,Fpassing showers. Fresh west to
OL,19,Fsouthwesterly winds, but less windy
OL,20,Fthan on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
