OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells and showers on Wednesday.
OL,7,FBright and mainly dry on Thursday.
OL,8,FRain spreading east on Friday.
OL,9,FBecoming somewhat colder.
